flowchart TD
  A[Webhook or poll hint] --> B[Validate tenant and source]
  B --> C[Deduplicate and queue]
  C --> D[Acquire mailbox lease]
  D --> E[Read trusted cursor]
  E --> F[Fetch provider changes]
  F --> G{Cursor valid?}
  G -- No --> H[Controlled full reconciliation]
  G -- Yes --> I[Normalize and deduplicate]
  H --> I
  I --> J[Commit records and cursor atomically]
  J --> K[Release lease and audit]
